From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shphadnis <sharada.phadnis@spectrocloud.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:54:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] spectro: build with Go 1.26.10

Pin every ubi9/ubi10 go-toolset builder to 1.26.10 (ubi9
1.26.10-1792592174, ubi10 1.26.10-1792583413). The CentOS Stream 9
virt-v2v builders keep their stage, since cgo needs libvirt-devel, but copy
in the same pinned Red Hat toolchain because CentOS's golang trails RHEL's
(1.26.7 at the time). ovirt-populator stays on ubi8 go-toolset 1.25.9:
there is no ubi8 1.26.10 build.
